      "derivation": "Generic descendant rule: every descendant of a generic element is handled generically, even when its QName (bpmn:task) belongs to a registered namespace. The child keeps its exact QName and MODEL URI as a generic identity.",
      "provenance": [
        "plan rev d: all descendants handled generically remain generic, even with a registered QName",
